			Increment Operators

Increment Operators
	• increases the value of a variable by one
	• has two forms

		Postfix Form
			x = 1;
			y = x++ //y = 1, x = 2
		Prefix Form
			x = 1;
			y = ++x //y = 2, x = 2

Decrement Operators
	• decreases the value of a variable by one
	• has two forms
		Postfix Form
			x = 1;
			y = x--; //y = 1, x = 0
		Prefix Form
			x = 1;
			y = --x; //y = 0, x = 0

Shortcut Assignment Operators
	x += y; same as x = x + y;
	x -= y; 	x = x – y;
	x *= y; 	x = x * y;
	x /= y; 	x = x / y; 
